<title>USA: China buys US soymeal, oil during w/e Dec 5 - USDA.</title>
<headline>China buys US soymeal, oil during w/e Dec 5 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China bought 54,500 tonnes of  U.S. soybean meal during the week ending Dec 5, the Agriculture Department said Thursday in its weekly report on U.S. Export Sales.</p>
<p>USDA also reported that China purchased 10,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean oil during that same week.</p>
